2139:# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------- effort vocabularies
2140:#
2141:# -Effort and the purpose presets speak low|medium|high|xhigh. What an endpoint accepts
2142:# is DECLARED, never inferred (no host-wide or model-prefix guess): capability table
2143:# caps-v1 -
2144:#   the built-in openai provider (no user table, no OPENAI_BASE_URL)
2145:#       vocabulary openai for any model (Codex validates its own models)   low medium high xhigh
2146:#   hosts api.z.ai, open.bigmodel.cn
2147:#       vocabulary zai (mapping zai-v1) ONLY for the declared models below  low high max
2148:#       (exact, case-sensitive): medium -> high, xhigh -> max
2149:#   hosts token-plan-ams.xiaomimimo.com, token-plan-cn.xiaomimimo.com, api.xiaomimimo.com
2150:#       vocabulary mimo (mapping mimo-v1) ONLY for the declared models     none low medium
2151:#       below (exact): low, medium, high as is, xhigh -> high               high
2152:# Anything else - an undeclared model on a known host, any model on another endpoint -
2153:# has no vocabulary: the run is refused unless -NativeEffort sends a value verbatim.
2154:# Codex's events do not report the effort the endpoint applied: effort_confirmed is null.
2155:$script:EffortCapsVersion = 'caps-v1'
2156:$script:EffortVocabularies = @{
2157:    'openai' = @{ Mapping = 'openai'; Map = @{ 'low' = 'low'; 'medium' = 'medium'; 'high' = 'high'; 'xhigh' = 'xhigh' } }
2158:    'zai'    = @{ Mapping = 'zai-v1'; Map = @{ 'low' = 'low'; 'medium' = 'high'; 'high' = 'high'; 'xhigh' = 'max' } }
2159:    'mimo'   = @{ Mapping = 'mimo-v1'; Map = @{ 'low' = 'low'; 'medium' = 'medium'; 'high' = 'high'; 'xhigh' = 'high' } }
2160:}
